Supporting Tau Ceti material is derived from revision 06d5bb4e3ebb737dc6538567f5c53bf8800b9362. Original author and copyright notices remain in the source; its Apache 2.0 license is retained under licenses/.

Publication preparation uses lowercase source paths and a generated local build workspace. Original Lean module identities, source text, proof bodies and verification guards are preserved byte for byte.

Palomar packaging adds a meta-only in-memory audit record buffer and makes only
audit-file persistence optional for read-only verification builds. All original
trust, axiom, declaration, dependency and principal-result assertions remain.
Mathematical declarations and their proofs are unchanged. The original audit
source and index are retained under verification/original-complete.lean.txt and
verification/original-source-index.json.

Four support declarations needed by the independent statement are made public
for stable module identities: TauCeti.SymmetricPower.algebraMultilinear, its
invariance theorem, TauCeti.SymmetricAlgebra.isIso_scalarSpecMap, and
SymmetricPower.lift_rel. Their
mathematical types, definition values and proof bodies are unchanged.
